<title>UK: Abbey National sets 55 million Ecu bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets 55 million Ecu bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES</p>
<p> AMT    55 MLN ECU    COUPON    *5.75	MATURITY    15.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS THEN EIGHT PERCENT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC (RATED AA/AA2)</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME. SENIOR AND UNSECURED</p>
<p>----London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
